      "location": "Bay St. Louis",
      "category": "Festival",
      "description": "Get ready for a hauntingly good time as the 7th Annual BOO in the Bay Parade returns to Old Town Bay St. Louis, Mississippi, on Saturday, October 17, 2026, at 5:30 p.m.Known as the largest costumed Halloween event on the Mississippi Gulf Coast, BOO in the Bay transforms the streets of historic Old Town into a thrilling Halloween spectacle filled with ghosts, goblins, witches, monsters, and creatures of every kind. Whether you're a lifelong Halloween enthusiast or looking for a fun-filled family event, this unforgettable parade promises an evening of excitement, entertainment, and community spirit.More than 1,000 costumed riders and participants will roll through downtown aboard spectacularly decorated golf carts, Jeeps, and classic cars, creating a dazzling Halloween procession unlike anything else on the Coast! Parade-goers can expect a shower of candy, Halloween trinkets, and thousands of festive throws as the spooky celebration winds its way through town.But that's only the beginning.BOO in the Bay will feature an incredible lineup of dance teams, marching groups, and roaming Halloween characters guaranteed to keep the energy high and the crowd entertained from start to finish. Around every corner, a new surprise awaits, making this one of the most anticipated Halloween events on the Coast!Want to Join the Parade?Registration is open by unit and limited to:Golf CartsJeepsClassic CarsParticipants can register now at www.boointhebay.com and become part of one of the Gulf Coast's most unique Halloween traditions.A Full Moon, a Grand Marshal & a Music VideoThis year's celebration brings an exciting new twist!Back by overwhelming demand, Choppa Style returns as the official Grand Marshal of BOO in the Bay 2026. Even more exciting, he will be showcasing his upcoming new hit, \"Full Moon,\" during the parade.The festivities will also serve as the filming location for the official \"Full Moon\" music video, giving attendees a chance to be part of the action. Guests are encouraged to wear their most creative Halloween costumes because when the cameras start rolling, you never know who might make an appearance in the final video!Experience the Magic of Halloween on the CoastFrom elaborate costumes and decorated parade units to live entertainment and unforgettable Halloween fun, BOO in the Bay has become a signature fall event for residents and visitors alike. Bring your family, gather your friends, and prepare for a night filled with candy, costumes, music, and Halloween magic under the glow of the full moon.Mark your calendar for Saturday, October 17, 2026, at 5:30 p.m. and experience the 7th Annual BOO in the Bay Parade in Bay St. Louis, Mississippi.For parade registration and event information, visit www.boointhebay.com.",
