      "location": "Gulfport/Biloxi",
      "category": "Dining",
      "description": "Experience a unique culinary event on the Mississippi Gulf Coast with The Secret Beach Table on Saturday, October 24, 2026!As the sun sets over the Gulf, guests will gather at what promises to be the longest beachfront dinner table ever assembled in Biloxi, creating an unforgettable evening of food, mystery, and connection along the beautiful Mississippi shoreline.Your Ticket IncludesCurated three-course buffet dinnerLive entertainmentFull cash bar available for purchaseStunning beachfront dining with panoramic Gulf viewsAn opportunity to meet fellow food lovers and culinary enthusiastsA one-of-a-kind social dining experienceSpecial discounted 1- and 2-bedroom suites at South Beach Biloxi Hotel & SuitesThe Secret ExperienceIn keeping with the spirit of surprise and discovery, the featured chef, culinary team, menu, and entertainment lineup will remain a mystery until shortly before the event.This extraordinary evening combines exceptional cuisine, Coastal beauty, and unforgettable experiences designed to bring people together in a truly unique setting.Open to the PublicThis is not a members-only event. Everyone is welcome to attend!Come early, grab a cocktail, enjoy the sunset, and take your seat among new friends. Whether you arrive with a partner, a group, or on your own, The Secret Beach Table is all about creating meaningful connections through great food and shared experiences.Who knows? You may find yourself dining beside a perfect stranger who becomes a lifelong friend!Event DetailsAge Requirement: Guests must be 18 years or older to attend.Guests are encouraged to wear all white or pastel attire to complement the elegant beachfront atmosphere and create a beautiful visual experience along the table.Guests may bring their favorite wine or champagne; however, all glass bottles must remain inside a cooler bag, as loose glass is not permitted on the beach.Plastic beverageware will be provided at each place setting. Beer, cocktails, and spirits will be available for purchase at the event's cash bar.Hotel AccommodationsTraveling from out of town? Discounted 1- and 2-bedroom suites at South Beach Biloxi Hotel & Suites are available for attendees. Your exclusive booking code will be provided after purchasing event tickets.Parking InformationComplimentary event parking will be available in:South Beach Biloxi Hotel parking lotDesignated parking area behind SharkheadsPlease do not park underneath Sharkheads, as vehicles may be subject to towing.An Unforgettable Gulf Coast EventThe chef may be a secret. The menu may be a mystery. But one thing is certain, The Secret Beach Table is set to be one of the premier food and dining Coast events.Reserve your seat and prepare for an evening filled with mystery, flavor, sunset views, and memories that will last a lifetime!",
