      "description": "Celebrate the magic of the holiday season at the Christmas City Gift Show, one of the Top 20 Tourism Events in the Southeast and a beloved Coast tradition for more than 43 years! Held along the beautiful Biloxi beachfront at the Mississippi Coast Convention Center, this festive shopping event features 300+ vendor booths and thousands of unique gifts, making it the perfect destination to kick off your holiday shopping.Browse an incredible selection of fashions, jewelry, gourmet foods, handcrafted artwork, home d\u00e9cor, specialty items, and one-of-a-kind gifts you won't find anywhere else! Enjoy special events throughout the weekend, including the adults-only Shopper's Paradise, Breakfast with Santa, door prizes, and a grand prize drawing.Event ScheduleFriday, November 13Shop Hours: 10 a.m. \u2013 4 p.m.Shopper's Paradise (Adults Only): 5 p.m. \u2013 9 p.m.Saturday, November 14Breakfast with Santa: 8 a.m. \u2013 9:15 a.m.Shop Hours: 9 a.m. \u2013 5 p.m.*Door prizes every 15 minutesSunday, November 15Shop Hours: 10 a.m. \u2013 4 p.m.Grand Prize Drawing at 3 p.m. (must be present to win)AdmissionGolden Ticket \u2013 $30: All-access admission for all three days, including Shopper's ParadiseDay Pass \u2013 $11: Valid Friday through Sunday; children 15 and under are free with a paying adult. Does not include Shopper's Paradise.Shopper's Paradise \u2013 $18: Exclusive adults-only shopping experience on Friday evening. Teens may attend with an adult. Separate ticket required.Breakfast with Santa: Adult plate $25.99; Child plate $14.99. Children receive a photo with Santa and a special surprise. Adult tickets include admission to the Christmas City Gift Show.Shop the Magic. Find the Joy. Join thousands of holiday shoppers in Biloxi for a festive weekend filled with unique gifts, seasonal cheer, and treasured Coast traditions!",
