      "description": "Event Dates and TimesDecember 12 - 27, Dark Mondays2 p.m. Performances | December 12 - 13, 18 - 20, 22 - 24, 26 - 277 p.m. Performances | December 12 - 13, 15 - 20, 22 \u2013 27Make everyone\u2019s holiday wishes come true this season with Christmas in the Air at Beau Rivage! Experience a first-class, family-friendly holiday spectacular, featuring breathtaking, synchronized high-kicking dancers inspired by the Rockettes, world-class singers and actors, and special appearances from Santa and his festive friends. Christmas in the Air seamlessly blends the magic of a Broadway-style song-and-dance revue with a heartwarming holiday story. Audiences are guided by two of Santa\u2019s spirited elves on an unforgettable Christmas adventure, featuring timeless holiday classics and modern favorites. The show dazzles with spectacular choreography, stunning costumes, and precision dance numbers that must be seen to be believed. With hilarious audience participation scenes and a talented supporting cast, Christmas in the Air promises festive fun and cherished memories for every member of the family. Continue your holiday tradition with a one-of-a-kind Christmas card experience from Beau Rivage this season! Produced & directed by Jeb K. Rand (of Rand Productions), producer of Footloose the Musical, Elf the Musical, Grease the Musical, A Christmas Story the Musical, and most recently Shrek the Musical at Beau Rivage.Tickets start at $14.95Four-Packs for $45 (offer code: FAMILY)Four-Packs for $55 (offer code: CHRISTMAS)VIP Experience available for an additional $25 + tax. Call 1.888.567.6667 for details and to purchase directly.Digital Cast Photo on StageExclusive Show LaminateAutographed Show Poster*VIP Packages are available on all seat purchases at checkout. Limited availability.",
