      "location": "Gulfport/Biloxi",
      "category": "Festival",
      "description": "Set sail for one of the largest boating events on the Mississippi Gulf Coast at the Biloxi Boat Show 2027! Whether you're an avid angler, weekend cruiser, watersports enthusiast, or love life on the water, this annual boating event brings together the latest boats, marine technology, personal watercraft, and family-friendly entertainment under one roof.Explore an impressive selection of fishing boats, luxury cruisers, pontoons, center consoles, personal watercraft, motors, and marine accessories from leading manufacturers and dealers. With hundreds of products on display, the Biloxi Boat Show is the perfect opportunity to compare models, connect with industry experts, and take advantage of exclusive boat show pricing available only during the event.Why Attend the Biloxi Boat Show?Shop the newest 2027 boat models in one convenient locationCompare boats, motors, and marine equipment side-by-sideAccess special show-only deals and pricingMeet boating and fishing professionalsEnjoy family-friendly activities and educational seminarsWatch the exciting Fetch-N-Fish Dog Show performancesWhether you're ready to purchase your next boat or just beginning your search, the Biloxi Boat Show offers an unforgettable experience for boating enthusiasts of all ages.Special Events ScheduleFriday, March 5Fetch-N-Fish Dog Show: 4 PM & 6 PMPro Talk Seminar Series: 5:30 PMRalph Humphreys \u2013 \"Reefs\"Saturday, March 6Pro Talk Seminar Series: 11:30 AMKids Fishing 101: 1 PMPro Talk Seminar Series: 2:30 PMEaston Barrett \u2013 \"Water Survival\"Pro Talk Seminar Series: 5:30 PMBritt Ordes \u2013 \"Fishing the LA Marsh\"Fetch-N-Fish Dog Show: 12 PM, 3 PM & 6 PMSunday, March 7Fetch-N-Fish Dog Show: 12 PM, 2 PM & 4 PMKids Fishing 101: 1 PMPro Talk Seminar Series: 2:30 PMBill HancockCCA Boat Giveaway: 4 PMAdmission & ParkingAdults: (Door) $15; (Online) $12 | Kids (15 and under): FreeMilitary Discount: $3 off admission at the door with a valid military IDParking: Available at the Mississippi Coast Coliseum for $10 per vehicleDiscover Your Next Adventure on the WaterFrom offshore fishing rigs to family cruisers and personal watercraft, there\u2019s something for every boating lifestyle at the Biloxi Boat Show. Walk the docks, meet fellow boating enthusiasts, and find the perfect vessel for your next Coast adventure.Don't miss the premier boat show in Biloxi, Mississippi, where boating, fishing, education, and family fun come together for one unforgettable weekend!",
